tails.","short_summary":"Get oriented to Siena’s major athletics and recreation complex.","evidence_claim":"Siena says the Marcelle Athletic Complex includes a gym, swimming pool, racquetball and squash courts, elevated track, and four basketball courts.","source_url":"https://www.siena.edu/life-as-a-saint/athletics-and-fitness/","source_title":"Athletics and Fitness | Siena University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility access and programming vary; the accessibility map identifies Lot W entrances and accessible bathrooms on all floors via the main-lobby elevator.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"beaudoin-theatre","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Beaudoin Theatre","title":"7. Spot Beaudoin Theatre","subtitle":"Foy Hall","notes":"Find the theatre in Foy Hall and watch Siena’s Creative Arts channels for a scheduled performance, audition, or production opportunity that suits your weekend.","short_summary":"Know where Siena’s main-stage performances take place.","evidence_claim":"Siena identifies Beaudoin Theatre in Foy Hall as its main-stage performance space.","source_url":"https://www.siena.edu/departments/creative-arts/our-facilities/","source_title":"Our Facilities | Siena University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Performance availability and any ticketing depend on the specific production; confirm details with Creative Arts.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sarazen-student-union","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Sarazen Student Union","title":"8. Make the Union your evening hub","subtitle":"Sarazen Student Union (SSU)","notes":"Use the Union as a meet-up point, check the welcome desk for campus information, and look for a currently schedu